          <span>oscar falemara · london, 51.5° n · no rockets were harmed</span>
          <span>
            <button type="button" data-land>↓ return to pad</button> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
            <a href="/v2/fable/lost">lost?</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
            <a href="/">back to v1</a>
          </span>
